<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.ResetAnimationOverride(AnimationState: string)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llResetAnimationOverride(string AnimationState);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Resets the animation override of the specified animation state (<b>anim_state</b>) to the corresponding default value.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>AnimationState / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/anim_state" target="_blank">anim_state</a></td>
          <td>animation state to be reset</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>avatar_animation</li>
        <li>permissions</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="dash-section-title">Permissions</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>PERMISSION_OVERRIDE_ANIMATIONS</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">502</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>To run this function the script must request the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PERMISSION_OVERRIDE_ANIMATIONS" target="_blank">PERMISSION_OVERRIDE_ANIMATIONS</a> permission with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRequestPermissions" target="_blank">llRequestPermissions</a>.</p>
